    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.25\">¼ tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Pul biber (mild red-pepper flakes)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Beat eggs briefly in a cup.</li><li>Lower heat and pour into the thick sauce.</li><li>Wait 20 seconds, then fold slowly with a spatula for about 2–4 minutes.</li><li>Stop when eggs form soft set folds with no runny raw egg; an egg-mixture temperature of <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"71\" data-s=\"0\">71 °C</span></b> gives a conservative endpoint.</li><li>Avoid constant vigorous stirring into dry crumbs.</li></ul>",
